MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2075258877}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 31d97d943f616874496536519f0de0c7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TD_Game.ContextTutorial
  panel: {fileID: 2075258880}
  text: {fileID: 1948657171}
  secondsPerHint: 5
  fadeTime: 0.25
  startHint: "WASD / left stick: move   \xB7   SHIFT: sprint   \xB7   SPACE: jump\nLand
    on an enemy from a jump to AMBUSH it."
  combatHint: "1 Attack (press 1 again on NOW! for a critical)   \xB7   2 / 3 skills  
    \xB7   4 potion   \xB7   5 Tonalli Burst\nArrows: change target   \xB7   Q: end
    turn. Every action costs stamina."
  dodgeHint: 'The enemy glows red before it strikes.

    Press SPACE when DODGE!
    appears. Pressing late (but in time) is a PERFECT dodge.'
  interruptHint: 'Spells cannot be dodged.

    Press 1 when INTERRUPT! appears to
    break the spell.'
  orbsHint: "Walk over the orbs before leaving:\ngold = Macuahuitl charge   \xB7  
    green = life   \xB7   blue = Tonalli"
  unlockHint: You learned a new skill. Use it in battle with its key (2 or 3).
  defeatHint: 'You return to the last place where you won a battle.

    Your progress
    is kept and you always get potions to retry.'
  secondsBetweenTips: 25
  explorationTips:
  - The map of the whole level is in the top right corner. The red dot is you.
  - Enemies chase you when they see you. Walls hide you from them.
  - Defeated enemies drop gold. The merchant in the Valley of Tlazolteotl sells potions
    and an artifact.
  - Green orbs heal you, blue orbs fill your Tonalli. Collect them after every battle.
  - 'Defeat every servant of the gods: the obsidian key opens the door to Quetzalcoatl.'
  - Press ESC to pause the game and change the volume.
